 the most luxurious Korean bathhouse experience – only here at King Spa Virginia!\n\nYou can visit on your own, bring your significant other or invite your friends and family for a whole day of health and relaxation.\n\nUnlike most European saunas with overly hot temperatures, our Korean bathhouse and saunas have surprisingly tolerable temperature levels. We value your wellness, ensuring that everything inside our facility is safe and healthy. Discover the key differences in our guide to <a href=\"/blog/korean-spa-vs-traditional-spa/\">Korean spa vs traditional spa</a> experiences."},{"_type":"widget","_key":"4410000","wtype":"accordion.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-4410000 elementor-widget elementor-widget-accordion","attrs":{"data-id":"4410000","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"accordion.default"},"html":"<div class=\"elementor-accordion\">\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-7131\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"1\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-7131\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">Herbal Sauna Rooms</a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-7131\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-7131\" role=\"region\"><p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Every person who walks into our <a href=\"/saunas-therapy-rooms/\">Korean saunas</a> and baths gets to sweat therapeutically.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-7132\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"2\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-7132\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">Massage Rooms</a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-7132\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-7132\" role=\"region\"><p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">If you want to experience the most effective massage you’ve had in years, then try our <a href=\"/massage-therapy/\">massage treatments</a>. Our private massages calm down your sore muscles so you can literally sleep like a baby. A few minutes in, and you will already feel the difference!</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-7133\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"3\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-7133\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">Korean Body Scrub</a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-7133\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-7133\" role=\"region\"><p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><a href=\"/body-scrub-2/\">Korean </a><em>seshin are </em>revitalizing scrubs that remove your dead skin. Getting a professional scrub is a good idea if you want to get back that healthy glow.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n<div aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-7134\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"4\" id=\"elementor-tab-title-7134\" role=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left\">\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n</span>\n<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">Complete Restaurant</a>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-7134\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" id=\"elementor-tab-content-7134\" role=\"region\"><p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">You’ll surely get hungry after a few hours of detoxification! We offer a <a href=\"/dining-and-refreshments/\">full restaurant</a> with sumptuous and healthy meals inside our facilities.</p><p><strong>Media Theater Room</strong></p><p>You can sit back and watch TV as you take a sip into our refreshing drinks.</p><p><strong>Cold Baths</strong></p><p>You can also rest, relax, and rejuvenate your senses in our cold bath and outdoor bade pool facilities. Remember to wear your swimsuit if you want to take a dip in the pools!</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>"}],"wrapCls":"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"},{"_type":"column","_key":"6ece35e","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6ece35e slider-wrap","attrs":{"data-id":"6ece35e","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column"},"children":[{"_type":"widget","_key":"fdbdcbb","wtype":"image-carousel.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-fdbdcbb elementor-pagination-position-inside elementor-arrows-position-inside elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-carousel","attrs":{"data-id":"fdbdcbb","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-settings":"{\"slides_to_show\":\"1\",\"navigation\":\"both\",\"autoplay\":\"yes\",\"pause_on_hover\":\"yes\",\"pause_on_interaction\":\"yes\",\"autoplay_speed\":50